            "pk": "18124871542520702",
            "text": "🚀 BetterFuture by DOMiNO Ventures!\n\nBetterFuture program supports early-stage B2B SaaS startups from Central Asia with global ambitions, and applications are now OPEN for Batch #4! \n\n📊 BetterFuture is a cross-border acceleration program designed to empower early-stage startups from Central Asia by connecting them with a global network of VCs, mentors, and successful founders.\n\nWho we’re looking for:\n• B2B SaaS focus with a scalable business model\n• MVP or early traction\n• Ambitious team that is building a solution for markets beyond Central Asia \n\n📌 Program launch: Mid-January \n⏳Deadline to apply: January 4th \nOnly selected startups will participate\n\nWhat you’ll get: \nInvestment opportunity \nAccess to a strong global investor network \nEntrepreneurial skills training International mentors & founders network\n\n💼 The 8-week online program ends with an in-person Demo Day, giving selected teams exposure to investors across Europe, the USA, Asia, and Türkiye - and the tools to grow globally.\n\n🔗 Apply via the link in our profile under the “Programs” section."
        },
